# a constant changed
-- old.cue --
a: 1
-- new.cue --
a: 2
-- out --
incompatible
a fills with 2 when absent, where the prior schema filled it with 1; prior instances that omit it change value (rule default-changed) @ new.cue:1:1
a was 1 and is now 2; prior instances holding 1 here are rejected (rule value-narrowed) @ new.cue:1:1
